# Caddy on firewall-vm — rewrite host.docker.internal → LAN IPs after Mac strip.
# Replace MINI_LAN_IP and PI_LAN_IP before deploy.
# Services already on firewall-vm use 127.0.0.1 via host-gateway OR the published port on <lan-ip:firewall-vm>.

